<title>UK: Den Norske Bank sets $200 million three-year FRN. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Den Norske Bank sets $200 million three-year FRN. [CORRECTED 12:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects borrower from Den Norske Stats Oljeselskap to Den Norkse Bank in headline and text.)</p>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEN NORSKE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    15.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.997    FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.997</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE ON COUPON DATES FROM OCTOBER 15, 1998 WITH</p>
<p>30 DAYS NOTICE, NOT 144A ELIGIBLE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
